  "<16-hex node id> http://100.x.y.z:7777 <64-hex key> — Enter asks": "<16-hex node id> http://100.x.y.z:7777 <64-hex key> — Enter를 누르면 확인을 요청합니다",
  "<64-hex pubkey> [member|admin] — no revoke tool, Enter asks": "<64-hex pubkey> [member|admin] — 취소 도구 없음, Enter를 누르면 확인을 요청합니다",
